{{!
  Template: dsar-export-ready
  Data keys:
    - name             {string} Recipient's first name
    - expiresAt        {string} Formatted expiration date (e.g. 7 days from generation)
    - appUrl           {string} Base URL of the app
    - unsubscribeToken {string}
    - currentYear      {number}
}}
<p class='email-greeting'>Your Personal Data Archive is Ready 📦</p>

<p>
  Hello{{#if name}} {{name}}{{/if}},
</p>

<p>
  In accordance with your data portability request (GDPR Article 15/20 &amp;
  CCPA § 1798.110), your personal data archive has been securely compiled.
</p>

<div class='email-alert email-alert--info'>
  <strong>Security &amp; Privacy Notice:</strong><br />
  To protect your sensitive personal information, no direct file download links
  are sent via email. Please log in to your BreathAway account to securely
  download your archive.
</div>

<div
  style='background-color: #F9FAFB; border: 1px solid #E5E7EB; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px 24px; margin: 24px 0;'
>
  <table style='width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;'>
    <tr>
      <td style='padding: 6px 0; color: #6B7280; font-size: 14px;'>Archive
        Format:</td>
      <td
        style='padding: 6px 0; text-align: right; font-weight: 600; color: #1A1A2E; font-size: 14px;'
      >AES-256 Encrypted ZIP</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style='padding: 6px 0; color: #6B7280; font-size: 14px;'>Retention
        Window:</td>
      <td
        style='padding: 6px 0; text-align: right; font-weight: 600; color: #E11D48; font-size: 14px;'
      >Available for 7 Days</td>
    </tr>
    {{#if expiresAt}}
      <tr>
        <td style='padding: 6px 0; color: #6B7280; font-size: 14px;'>Expiration
          Date:</td>
        <td
          style='padding: 6px 0; text-align: right; color: #6B7280; font-size: 13px;'
        >{{expiresAt}}</td>
      </tr>
    {{/if}}
  </table>
</div>

<p>
  <strong>How to access your archive:</strong>
</p>
<ol
  style='color: #4B5563; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; padding-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 24px;'
>
  <li>Log in to your BreathAway mobile application or web portal.</li>
  <li>Navigate to
    <strong>Settings &gt; Privacy &amp; Data &gt; Export History</strong>.</li>
  <li>Click
    <strong>Download Archive</strong>
    to download your encrypted export file.</li>
  <li>Use the passphrase provided during your export request to decrypt and
    extract your files.</li>
</ol>

<div style='text-align: center; margin: 32px 0;'>
  <a href='{{appUrl}}/settings/privacy' class='email-btn'>Go to Privacy Settings
    →</a>
</div>

<hr class='email-divider' />

<p style='font-size: 13px; color: #9CA3AF; text-align: center;'>
  BreathAway Privacy &amp; Compliance Team
</p>